530dd706 3x"}, "body": "我可以再請求一次嗎？你能取悅正在互動的北極熊和野狗嗎？它們基於參考資料夾中的人類角色，但我希望看到它們按照您的風格繪製為動物。北極熊性格桀騁不馴、隨性，但暗地裡他也非常危險。他被野狗的滑稽動作逗樂了。他通常很放鬆。他有些懶。同時，野狗個性健談、調皮、頑皮。他非常喜歡北極熊，並且不斷試圖吸引他的注意。他經常被北極熊戲弄。請畫一幅野狗守護北極熊的場景。北極熊就像黑手黨老大。野狗就像他忠誠的下屬。謝謝你！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1wFWfUyRKSUT9Zn3KUrWZ8U9E5OnAtgww?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@koma_ver0/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2954793, "client_id": 187973, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3daae41ba3f96d7e6a5480815fd7f74d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3daae41ba3f96d7e6a5480815fd7f74d, https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16a13d3b31cfdc8b2c9e4a1e79f21ee 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=fd2daa195c78e59df66723ec14e9c77b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8f5ccb40c84820d2d227fad63a11d20", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a8f5ccb40c84820d2d227fad63a11d20, https://si.imgix.net/3de06415/uploads/origins/7a60a308-a00b-4ef3-870c-283c166b52d4